k":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T18:03:16-07:00","id":578009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Allan53</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/320047-the-cruellest-words-to-say-to-a-changeling?p=577229#post577229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Keeper to Changeling</b>: &quot;I'm sorry, do I know you?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You seem to have misread the title.<br /> <br /> This is the Cruelest Words, that precludes most changelings doing pelvic thrusts and throwing huge parties because their Keeper isn't after them anymore.<br /> <br /> Here's some: <br /> <br /> To Beast: &quot;Do you do tricks too, Fido?&quot;<br /> <br /> To Darkling: &quot;Nothing you've done is justified.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Elemental: &quot;Chaos is your cocaine. And you'll crash.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Fairest: &quot;Your friends remember what you did, and they hate you.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Ogre: &quot;Sharp edges doesn't make the teapot less broken.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Wizened: &quot;You tried to fix what was never broken. Congrats, now you have something to fix.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T18:14:40-07:00","id":578020,"title":"","content":"<b>Keeper to Changeling:</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Ready or not, here I come!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, I'm sorry. Did you want kids at some point?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;You should have told me you were planning to leave, I'd have sent your son a note before he got here!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Don't worry, I'll get that song out of your head. Now just lay back while I get the power tools!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T20:25:25-07:00","id":578084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/320047-the-cruellest-words-to-say-to-a-changeling?p=578009#post578009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You seem to have misread the title.<br /> <br /> This is the Cruelest Words, that precludes most changelings doing pelvic thrusts and throwing huge parties because their Keeper isn't after them anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was more going for a &quot;this entity took me, twisted me, and ruined my life, and I only barely managed to escape. And it doesn't even remember doing it?&quot; kind of thing. I know I'd find that pretty damn cruel. At least if the Fae is chasing them it implies it values them in some way, for them to have suffered so much for <i>no</i> reason, even a Fae-twisted reason? That's pretty damn awful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T20:47:46-07:00","id":578121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Allan53</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/320047-the-cruellest-words-to-say-to-a-changeling?p=578084#post578084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was more going for a &quot;this entity took me, twisted me, and ruined my life, and I only barely managed to escape. And it doesn't even remember doing it?&quot; kind of thing. I know I'd find that pretty damn cruel. At least if the Fae is chasing them it implies it values them in some way, for them to have suffered so much for <i>no</i> reason, even a Fae-twisted reason? That's pretty damn awful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, you got me there.<br /> <br /> Still, a lot of changelings already think there's no logic to Arcadia to begin with, so discovering there's no reason to be abducted that the Keeper recalls wouldn't be a surprise to many of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T22:56:31-07:00","id":578259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/320047-the-cruellest-words-to-say-to-a-changeling?p=578121#post578121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, you got me there.<br /> <br /> Still, a lot of changelings already think there's no logic to Arcadia to begin with, so discovering there's no reason to be abducted that the Keeper recalls wouldn't be a surprise to many of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a fair and entirely inarguable point. Course, the fact of Keepers chasing would seem to indicate at least some variability in that situation.<br /> <br /> To a Wizened: &quot;Is that all you've worked out? Jeez, you have a <i>lot</i> to learn.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-04T06:40:56-07:00","id":578683,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh stop crying. It's not like I'll let you permanently die!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T13:43:28-07:00","id":580155,"title":"","content":"'' Oh my, oh my, it is MAGNIFICENT! Darling, I made much of your useless kind into what you are now, but I must say, you are best. Not as pretty, but your smart mind-if I didn't know better, I would think you are my twin! And you are so fun with all that dancing and that toys-hand grenades you call them, do you-and you were so kind to bring me DOZENS AND DOZENS of new toys, so as thank, I will take you back home. Oh don't worry, we will exchange that ropes for thorns if you insist so much. Uh, you still cry? Well I know what will make you happier-your entire family, down to every cousin 1024 times removed is there and enjoying what I did to you! Family dinner-oh can I attend?<br /> ...<br /> Oh stop crying. Honestly, you humans are so sensitive.''","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6005-coolcat12345","name":"coolcat12345","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T07:34:13-07:00","id":580934,"title":"","content":"<b>To an Ogre</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Just have a seat, buddy. I'll tell you about the rabbits.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T10:14:50-07:00","id":581147,"title":"","content":"<b>To a Wizened:</b> &quot;Hey, not bad for a first try.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T14:41:00-07:00","id":581556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gaius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/320047-the-cruellest-words-to-say-to-a-changeling?p=581147#post581147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>To a Wizened:</b> &quot;Hey, not bad for a first try.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;You missed a spot&quot;<br /> <br /> May or may not be followed by dumping filth on their newly crafted / cleaned project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T20:01:32-07:00","id":581862,"title":"","content":"Based on the 2E curses:<br /> <br /> Beast: There are rules that not even you can break.<br /> Darkling: You can trust me, <i>I've </i>never betrayed <i>you.</i><br /> Elemental: You don't care who you hurt, do you?<br /> Fairest: I'd like to issue a vote of no confidence.<br /> Ogre: I bet you wouldn't even cry if your mother died.<br /> Wizened: Ugh, who let the Kardashian in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2283-andreamus","name":"andreamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T23:43:57-07:00","id":581995,"title":"","content":"<b>To a Beast</b><br /> <br /> &quot;This aint a nudist colony. Put some damn clothes on!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>To a Fairest</b><br /> <br /> &quot;You dun goofed&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>To a Wizened</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Unacceptable conditions! UNACCEPTABLE!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>To an Ogre</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, yeah... uhh, you weren't invited. This party is only for cultured members of the Freehold.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>To an Elemental</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Hey look, the trailer trash became a tornado!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>To a Darkling</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Are you <i>sure</i> you want to go with them?&quot; (might just send them into a paranoid fit)<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T02:35:08-07:00","id":583299,"title":"","content":"<b>Keeper to Orge</b>: &quot;You are strong... but i am beyond strength.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Beast: </b>&quot;You should of stayed in my forest... you wouldn't of realize what you've become.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Fairest</b>: &quot;Oh~ Don't mind me. I'm just checking up on my little (brother/sister). My! Look at you. Your almost all grown up!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Darkling</b>: &quot;You hide and sneak through the shadows and shades,.. and yet i still find you.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Wizened</b>: &quot; If you really understood how things work. You'd know there is no escape from me. But i'll fix that! &quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Elementa</b>l: &quot; Your so fiery! I wonder how much brighter your family would burn. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":1820,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","user":"Nightout","date":". 07-08-2015, 05:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T05:20:00-07:00","id":583398,"title":"","content":"Fairest one hits for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6005-coolcat12345","name":"coolcat12345","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T14:54:10-07:00","id":583881,"title":"","content":"<b>To a Wizened:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;So I think you should see a dentist.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T15:33:03-07:00","id":583912,"title":"","content":"&quot;They like your Fetch a lot more. Think I'm lying just to get under your skin? Try and watch them on Christmas.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You are not in control of your life. You never were, and never will be.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The world goes by just fine without you. It goes by without every person who's ever fallen into Our hands.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;My, my...look at that. Fresh out of the thorns and you are already looking a lot like your old master. Acting like me, even.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Everything in the universe is just one big story, little one. And all stories must have conflict.&quot; (said to a changeling who has just experienced the worst tragedy since her Durance)<br /> <br /> &quot;Odds are you'll just get taken by Them again.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T16:14:57-07:00","id":583967,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh come on, you know full well nothing happens in Arcadia without agreeing to a contract. You honestly think you escaped free of charge? For every slave that runs away, a new one takes their place!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T09:27:13-07:00","id":646871,"title":"","content":"For 2ed:<br /> <br /> Wizened: &quot;Specialization is for the mediocre&quot;.<br /> <br /> Fairest: &quot;Attention whoring is not leadership.&quot;<br /> <br /> Darkling: &quot;I hope you like shadows, they are the only friends you will ever have.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ogre: &quot;Your skin might be thick, but you are completely transparent.&quot;<br /> <br /> Beast: &quot;The more you bite, the tighter your leash will get.&quot;<br /> <br /> Elemental: &quot;You are even more egotistical than before, that's why only trees listen to you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T10:54:14-07:00","id":646952,"title":"","content":"General, all purpose line:<br /> <br /> &quot;You remind me of our Keeper.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T23:40:02-07:00","id":647708,"title":"","content":"&quot;You were always an animal, I just gave you claws&quot;-William Stryker","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T07:49:43-07:00","id":648028,"title":"","content":"<b>Ogre / Beast</b><br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not angry with you, I'm just disappointed.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Elemental</b><br /> <br /> &quot;This room is a mess! Did a tornado blow through here or something?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Wizened</b><br /> <br /> &quot;tsk, of course I didn't read the fucking manual!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Fairest</b><br /> <br /> &quot;You're like the Return of the King. You go on and on even when you've made your point!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>All</b><br /> <br /> &quot;So if Fae are the stuff of dreams, you can never really escape them, can you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T16:08:44-07:00","id":659999,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hello, father/mother&quot;. - said by the sociopathic child of a fetich, in a padded cell, to the visiting Changeling.<br /> &quot;Does this mean I have to give the money back?&quot; - said to somebody who <i>sold</i> their child to the True Fae.<br /> &quot;Monster! Stay away from my family!&quot; - said by a fetich, looking at his Changeling, wielding torch and pitchfork in genuine attempt to protect the Changeling's wife and child.<br /> &quot;If you are who you say you are, why is your ghost in the Underworld?&quot; - said by a Geist, to the Changeling, while both of them are visiting the underworld and the changeling's ghost is, apparently, right in front of them.<br /> &quot;But I need you! I need all of you! I can almost feel it, that spark. I'm almost human again.&quot; - said by a True Fae that has been collecting soul fragments from its victims in an attempt to 'become human again'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T05:49:52-07:00","id":661824,"title":"","content":"&quot;I already told you, foolish boy: all the people who once knew you already moved on. You no longer belong there. This is your home &quot; <br /> (Keeper to his runaway slave after the later tried and failed in leaving the Hedge throught a Gateway)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T06:41:33-07:00","id":661846,"title":"","content":"&quot;Now you'll understand. You'll understand all of it. Thank you child. Thank you for granting me my freedom at last!&quot;<br /> <br /> Said by a dying Keeper to his Wyrd 10 Changeling Killer","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2225-ganonso","name":"ganonso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T22:33:59-07:00","id":662694,"title":"","content":"&quot;I stalked you for years before I took you away. You honestly think I don't know your next move?&quot; said by a Keeper to one of their escapees.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T08:52:40-07:00","id":673234,"title":"","content":"&quot;Mommy? But she died with daddy years ago.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/822-daemonchrno","name":"DaemonChrno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar822_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T09:21:39-07:00","id":673250,"title":"","content":"&quot;I can rebuild him... I have the technology!&quot; A Keeper talking about a Changeling who died in battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-22T11:08:32-07:00","id":674405,"title":"","content":"&quot;What, marry you? Our romance was just scripted by the Keeper. We're free now and I think its time we see other people.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-22T13:37:35-07:00","id":674558,"title":"","content":"&quot;No Changeling has ever harmed another, till now&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You are the weakest Link&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh wait you mean Changeling the lost, not changelings from Star Trek: Deep Space Nine.<br /> <br /> Oops \ud83d\ude00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-22T19:34:22-07:00","id":674806,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm getting bored, boy.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-23T13:42:26-07:00","id":675683,"title":"","content":"&quot;You don't remember? You got black out drunk and claimed you were the Lizard Queen. She's here to defend her title!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-25T09:33:46-07:00","id":677678,"title":"","content":"&quot;Perhaps you and your son would understand each other better if he saw what you have seen.&quot; A Loyalist asking to have his face punched<br /> <br /> &quot;Your soul is too torn to enter an afterlife, I'm afraid. Perhaps I can find a way to fix that.&quot; Shady Mage or Goblin Merchant, said to changeling with a phobia of death<br /> <br /> &quot;Are these your cousins?&quot; he said to the Beast as he gestured toward the filth coated briarwolves.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have seen his dreams, and I don't think he's your friend.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;If you people were trustworthy, you wouldn't need so many oaths and vows.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It seems you have fallen back on old habits. I guess your escape doesn't mean much to you.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-26T01:28:06-07:00","id":678633,"title":"","content":"&quot;Welcome home.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.